iv><p class=\"kicker\">关于本店</p><h2>不只是剪发，更是一种享受。</h2><p>Marty&#39;s 是 Nut Tree Road 上一家复古工业风的理发店，氛围很棒，理发师阵容强大。本店的信念是：“看起来好，心情就永远好。”</p><p>Marty 和我们的团队累计有 1,300 多条顾客评价，平均 4.9 分。在线预约你的理发师，或致电本店。</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Marty%27s+Barbershop/@38.334085,-121.954199,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d18bfa90d17:0x87e0c0043f59cd49!8m2!3d38.334085!4d-121.954199!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.9★</b><span>176 条评价</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>1,332</b><span>理发师获得的顾客评价</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>9</b><span>可预约理发师</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/interior.jpg\" alt=\"Marty&#39;s Barbershop 店内\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">价目</p><h2>剪发与价格</h2><p>Marty 的价目单，以及我们提供的更多服务。每位理发师都有自己的价目单，点击下方理发师查看。</p></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>理发</h3><span class=\"price\">$40</span></div><p>渐变、修边、半圆渐变、莫西干、侧背头等。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>理发＋胡须</h3><span class=\"price\">$60</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>理发＋传统剃须</h3><span class=\"price\">$75</span></div><p>任意发型，加上热毛巾、剃须泡和蒸汽的干净剃刀剃须。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>理发＋鼻毛蜡除</h3><span class=\"price\">$50</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>传统剃须</h3><span class=\"price\">$40</span></div><p>热毛巾、蒸汽、热剃须泡和直刃剃刀。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>理发＋洗发</h3><span class=\"price\">$50</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><spa