me I came in🫡💯”</blockquote><figcaption>— Jaden · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/263621_martythebarber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I was literally walking out of my doctors appointment thinking about looking for a barber when I crossed paths with the owner. He brought me in and the vibes were amazing. Great people, amazing skills and overall amazing experience. It didn’t feel like going in to just get a cut. I got an experience.You gotta get a fresh cut from these guys.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Viv does an amazing job! She’s thorough, detail-oriented, and listens to her clients. Every haircut I’ve gotten from her is great and grows out well between cuts!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Kendra · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/658054_hercuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Thank you, Hudson for making our first experience at this barbershop and with you great! It is evident you take pride in your craft and the results show for itself. We are very satisfied with our son’s haircut by you. I definitely recommend booking with him. Thank you!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Jared always does a great job. Great attention to Detail and many years of experience. If you’re looking for a new barber,Jared is the guy. He’s been cutting my hair for over 10 years.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Bradley · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1694168_thatboy-reezy_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“He cut my haircut like how I imagined it. Takes his time and doesn’t rush. Cleanest skin mid fade in the area”</blockquote><figcaption>— Nish · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/966669_joe-big-money-lopez_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Carlos provided a great cut along with efficient timing, I would highly recommend his services!👌🏽”</blockquote><figcaption>— Emani · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/593463_losblendzz_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“10/10 recommend this shop! Marty cuts my sons hair an always is quick, smooth and always makes my sons experience exceptional. If your not getting your hair cut here your missing out.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great haircut, Good convo &amp; Good vibes. Eli got me right. Thanks!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Alex024 · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1244424_fadezbyeli-martysbarbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">常见问题</p><h2>常见问题解答</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>需要预约吗？</summary><p>我们每个人都可以在线预约。周日仅接受预约，平日和周六营业时间欢迎直接到店。</p></details><details><summary>理发多少钱？</summary><p>标准理发 $40–$50，视理发师而定。请在你理发师的预约页面查看最新价格。</p></details><details><summary>有长者或军人折扣吗？</summary><p>有。我们多位理发师提供长者（65 岁以上）理发 $30，军人/急救人员理发 $35–$40。</p></details><details><summary>有热毛巾剃须吗？</summary><p>当然有。Marty 的传统剃须 $40，理发加热毛巾传统剃须 $75。Viviana 和 Joe 也提供传统剃刀剃须。</p></details><details><summary>收卡吗？</summary><p>收，我们接受刷卡。</p></details><details><summary>有 Wi-Fi 和无障碍通道吗？</summary><p>有。我们提供免费 Wi-Fi，店里也有无障碍通道。</p></details><details><summary>营业时间是什么时候？</summary><p>周一至周五上午 9 点至下午 6 点，周六上午 9 点至下午 3 点。周日仅接受预约。</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">欢迎光临</p>\n      <h2>营业时间和地址</h2>\n      <address>2611 Nut Tree Rd Ste E<br>Vacaville, CA 95687</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076608108\">(707) 660-8108</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>星期一</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>星期二</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>星期三</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>星期四</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>星期五</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>星期六</td><td>9 AM – 3 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>星期日</td><td>休息</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">周日仅接受预约。</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/martysbarbershop_/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg><span>@m